  ("Arancini", "Golden fried rice balls stuffed with meat sauce, peas and cheese. A North End lunch staple, and Galleria Umberto's are legendary.", "dish_arancini"),
  ("Cannoli", "Crisp shells and sweet ricotta, the signature of the North End.", "dish_cannoli"),
